---
name: sanity-run-table
version: 2.0.0
description: Sanity ledger rows, two per run (LLM, JEV), rendered from the ledger tail.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - runs
---
| S | PR | R | Find | Result | Match | Done | Iter |
|:--|:--|:--|---:|:--|:--|:--|---:|
{% for run in runs %}| {{ run.sprint }} | {% if run.pr_number %}#{{ run.pr_number }}{% else %}—{% endif %} | {% if run.reviewer == "sanity-jev" %}JEV{% elif run.reviewer == "sanity-llm" %}LLM{% else %}{{ run.reviewer }}{% endif %} | {% if run.verdict == "CANNOT_RUN" %}—{% else %}{{ run.findings }}{% endif %} | {% if run.verdict == "PASS" %}✅{% elif run.verdict == "FAIL" %}❌{% else %}⚠ unavailable{% endif %} | {% if not run.final_verdict | default("") %}—{% elif run.verdict == run.final_verdict %}✓{% else %}✗{% endif %} | {{ run.completed_local | default(run.completed_at) }} · {{ run.duration }} | {{ run.iteration }} |
{% endfor %}
